w)\">← Previous</button>\n27:         <button id=\"btnSubStep\" class=\"btn-nav btn-substep\" title=\"Step through internal sub-expressions on this line (F7)\">🔍 Sub-Expr (F7)</button>\n28:         <button id=\"btnNext\" class=\"btn-nav btn-next-prominent\" title=\"Explain the next step (Right Arrow)\">Next Step →</button>\n29:         <button id=\"btnAutoPlay\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Automatically step through the code\">▶ Auto Play</button>\n30:         <button id=\"btnRestart\" class=\"btn-nav\" title=\"Start over from Step 1\">↺ Restart</button>\n31:       </nav>\n32:     </div>\n33: \n34:     <div class=\"top-bar-secondary\">\n35:       <div class=\"secondary-actions\">\n36:         <button id=\"btnToggleAnim\" class=\"btn-subtle active\" title=\"Toggle visual animations on or off\">✨ Animations: ON</button>\n37:         <button id=\"btnToggleQuiz\" class=\"btn-subtle\" title=\"Toggle interactive prediction questions on or off\">🎯 Predict: OFF</button>\n38:         <button id=\"btnSpeed\" class=\"btn-subtle\" title=\"Adjust Auto Play & Animation Speed\">⚡ Speed: 1x</button>\n39:         <button id=\"btnEditCode\" class=\"btn-small-primary\">✏️ Paste / Edit Code</button>\n40:         <button id=\"btnToggleIterations\" class=\"btn-subtle\" title=\"Show or hide the complete Iteration & All-Steps history\">📋 Execution History</button>\n41:         <button id=\"btnToggleAdvanced\" class=\"btn-subtle\">Advanced View</button>\n42:       </div>\n43:     </div>\n44:   </header>\n45: \n46:   <!-- Error / Validation Banner (Hidden unless there is an error) -->\n47:   <div id=\"validationBanner\" class=\"validation-banner hidden\"></div>\n48: \n49:   <!-- Dynamic Overview Banner -->\n50:   <div class=\"overview-strip\">\n51:     <span class=\"overview-label\">Goal:</span>\n52:     <span id=\"overviewText\">Paste or edit any Python program on the left to visualize every step, iteration, variable scope, and memory address.</span>\n53:   </div>\n54: \n55:   <!-- Quick Test